[["Map",1,2,9,10],"meta::meta",["Map",3,4,5,6,7,8],"astro-version","5.18.2","content-config-digest","23c09976a150c52c","astro-config-digest","{\"root\":{},\"srcDir\":{},\"publicDir\":{},\"outDir\":{},\"cacheDir\":{},\"compressHTML\":true,\"base\":\"/\",\"trailingSlash\":\"ignore\",\"output\":\"static\",\"scopedStyleStrategy\":\"attribute\",\"build\":{\"format\":\"directory\",\"client\":{},\"server\":{},\"assets\":\"_astro\",\"serverEntry\":\"entry.mjs\",\"redirects\":true,\"inlineStylesheets\":\"auto\",\"concurrency\":1},\"server\":{\"open\":false,\"host\":false,\"port\":4321,\"streaming\":true,\"allowedHosts\":[]},\"redirects\":{},\"image\":{\"endpoint\":{\"route\":\"/_image\"},\"service\":{\"entrypoint\":\"astro/assets/services/sharp\",\"config\":{}},\"domains\":[],\"remotePatterns\":[],\"responsiveStyles\":false},\"devToolbar\":{\"enabled\":true},\"markdown\":{\"syntaxHighlight\":{\"type\":\"shiki\",\"excludeLangs\":[\"math\"]},\"shikiConfig\":{\"langs\":[],\"langAlias\":{},\"theme\":\"github-dark\",\"themes\":{},\"wrap\":false,\"transformers\":[]},\"remarkPlugins\":[],\"rehypePlugins\":[],\"remarkRehype\":{},\"gfm\":true,\"smartypants\":true},\"security\":{\"checkOrigin\":true,\"allowedDomains\":[],\"actionBodySizeLimit\":1048576},\"env\":{\"schema\":{},\"validateSecrets\":false},\"experimental\":{\"clientPrerender\":false,\"contentIntellisense\":false,\"headingIdCompat\":false,\"preserveScriptOrder\":false,\"liveContentCollections\":false,\"csp\":false,\"staticImportMetaEnv\":false,\"chromeDevtoolsWorkspace\":false,\"failOnPrerenderConflict\":false,\"svgo\":false},\"legacy\":{\"collections\":false}}","projects",["Map",11,12,34,35],"gift",{"id":11,"data":13,"body":21,"filePath":22,"digest":23,"rendered":24,"legacyId":33},{"name":14,"description":15,"url":16,"tags":17},"Gift 礼簿","移动端优先的礼金记录工具——多项目管理、本地存储、零后端依赖","https://github.com/vhxubo/gift",[18,19,20],"工具","生活","React","礼簿（Gift Ledger）是一个纯前端礼金记录工具，数据安全存放在浏览器本地。\n\n**核心功能：**\n- 多项目独立管理礼金记录\n- 记录昵称（必填）、真实姓名、金额、收款方式、归属方及备注\n- 按昵称或真实姓名搜索，编辑/删除记录时提示重复昵称\n- 按归属、收款方式、金额排行及项目总额做统计\n- 导出全部数据为 JSON 备份，支持全量恢复\n- 手机端优先布局，支持深色模式和减少动画偏好\n\n**亮点：** 零后端、零账号——打开即用，数据完全由用户掌控。所有敏感信息不出浏览器。","src/content/projects/gift.md","857c58680e2914bd",{"html":25,"metadata":26},"\u003Cp>礼簿（Gift Ledger）是一个纯前端礼金记录工具，数据安全存放在浏览器本地。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>核心功能：\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>多项目独立管理礼金记录\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>记录昵称（必填）、真实姓名、金额、收款方式、归属方及备注\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>按昵称或真实姓名搜索，编辑/删除记录时提示重复昵称\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>按归属、收款方式、金额排行及项目总额做统计\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>导出全部数据为 JSON 备份，支持全量恢复\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>手机端优先布局，支持深色模式和减少动画偏好\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>亮点：\u003C/strong> 零后端、零账号——打开即用，数据完全由用户掌控。所有敏感信息不出浏览器。\u003C/p>",{"headings":27,"localImagePaths":28,"remoteImagePaths":29,"frontmatter":30,"imagePaths":32},[],[],[],{"name":14,"description":15,"url":16,"tags":31},[18,19,20],[],"gift.md","git-bluff",{"id":34,"data":36,"body":42,"filePath":43,"digest":44,"rendered":45,"legacyId":54},{"name":34,"description":37,"url":38,"tags":39},"从 Git 提交记录生成格式化日报/周报/月报——自动去噪、按项目分组","https://github.com/vhxubo/git-bluff",[18,40,41],"生产力","Rust","git-bluff 是一个命令行工具，把零散的 Git 提交记录转化为可汇报的结构化文本。\n\n**核心功能：**\n- 扫描单仓库或多仓库的提交记录\n- 按日期范围、作者过滤\n- 通过 YAML 配置文件将仓储映射到项目，自动分组\n- 支持目录前缀、glob 模式和精确路径三种匹配方式\n- 自动清洗提交信息：去除 `git-svn-id`、conventional commit 前缀（`feat:`、`fix:` 等）\n\n**输出模式：无配置时按仓库路径列出编号条目；有配置时按项目→子仓库两层分组，每条提交一行编号。**\n\n技术栈为 Rust，利用 `git2` 直接读 Git 对象库，不依赖 `git` CLI。","src/content/projects/git-bluff.md","0795212098e940a6",{"html":46,"metadata":47},"\u003Cp>git-bluff 是一个命令行工具，把零散的 Git 提交记录转化为可汇报的结构化文本。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>核心功能：\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>扫描单仓库或多仓库的提交记录\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>按日期范围、作者过滤\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>通过 YAML 配置文件将仓储映射到项目，自动分组\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>支持目录前缀、glob 模式和精确路径三种匹配方式\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>自动清洗提交信息：去除 \u003Ccode>git-svn-id\u003C/code>、conventional commit 前缀（\u003Ccode>feat:\u003C/code>、\u003Ccode>fix:\u003C/code> 等）\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>输出模式：无配置时按仓库路径列出编号条目；有配置时按项目→子仓库两层分组，每条提交一行编号。\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>技术栈为 Rust，利用 \u003Ccode>git2\u003C/code> 直接读 Git 对象库，不依赖 \u003Ccode>git\u003C/code> CLI。\u003C/p>",{"headings":48,"localImagePaths":49,"remoteImagePaths":50,"frontmatter":51,"imagePaths":53},[],[],[],{"name":34,"description":37,"url":38,"tags":52},[18,40,41],[],"git-bluff.md"]